    "descriptionHtml": "Panther VPN - Enjoy a Faster Connection and Unlock Blocked Content! <br>Unlock Apps and Safe Browsing on all Websites behind the firewall. <br><br>Besides that, this application also encrypts your connection and provides you with Faster Connection Speeds,  and this Secure VPN Free let you browse the internet privately and securely.<br><br>● One-tap protection – start an encrypted connection in one tap!<br><br>● Best location – enjoy instant VPN protection and Safe Browsing as you’re automatically matched with the best VPN server, based on your location.<br><br>● Access blocked content - hide your location and binge on your favorite shows and movies at excellent speed with the most secure vpn!<br><br>● Enjoy a 24/7 live chat support and ask us questions that we’ll be happy to help with anything!<br><br>+ Network test: Test WiFi speed, check your improved speeds for upload and download speed.<br>+ WiFi protector: Our Secure Vpn or Panther VPN guarantees safe connection during changing IP and protects your internet from hackers. Unlock blocked websites and enjoy a Safer Internet access<br><br>Panther VPN 2021 is a Free, Secure VPN that will help you to unlock websites and apps like social network websites, and provide you with unlimited access in order to watch videos, movies, and games.  <br>You can unblock the Geo-restrictions for any social websites or apps and you will easily access all these now unblocked websites or apps without any resistance.<br><br>■ What is a VPN<br><br>VPN stands for Virtual Private Network. When connecting to a VPN server through Augustro VPN or Surfshark VPN,for example - it sets up a secured and encrypted connection to the server in another country. <br>Because of the encryption process the data cannot be filtered or blocked. If you live in India for example, when connecting to a VPN server in US, your traffic would look like coming from the United States, instead of India.<br><br>■ Why using a VPN<br><br>With a VPN, you are not only able to unblock Geo-restricted or censored services, such as Facebook, Pandora and YouTube; your online privacy and security will be greatly improved as you’ll be surfing the web anonymously.",
